{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44973","headline":"杼山上峰和颜使君真卿袁侍御五韵赋得印字仍期明日登开元寺楼之会 · 皎然","name":"杼山上峰和颜使君真卿袁侍御五韵赋得印字仍期明日登开元寺楼之会","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道情寄远岳，放旷临千仞。\n香路延绦驺，华泉写金印。\n日欹诸天近，雨过三华润。\n留客云外心，忘机松中韵。\n灵嘉早晚期，爲布东山信。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}